<description>&lt;p&gt;Alvin Hellerstein, the 92‑year-old federal judge who oversaw the Maduro drug-trafficking case, has died, leaving the trial without a presiding judge. A soldier who allegedly bet $400,000 on Maduro’s removal was arrested by the DOJ, and a separate soldier faces a Polymarket insider-trading case. Explosive attacks near the Colombia-Venezuela border injured at least four police officers in one blast and six people, including four officers, in another. Nicolás Maduro is returning to federal court to face torture allegations. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOYU5SaWZoNkNlWGxRN19RTlgxMThNdTE3ZEJJNnVOdElDZzZGU05WZ3lITGdldnM1cHVkUGpUdm5pRUs1WmluYXJGRkxnOG1rYlVkT3A1MzZOcjE1ZFZLVnVvOFFvMnp3d3VJWW5ybVhza2pzT0R5a3VSU3NkMmxvbzhROS12SFN2bmJsa1Zpbl9hdGo1LUVYdHI1d2VBa0hGY1hjUEx2WWJ3WUFHN0swazNEaXk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Democracy Now!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1BR1hEUmpuQUZjTXEwLU5TeW1FbWpSWUtaUVAtRmxzcU5WUTVnc1ZXUlBrYzlfWE04Ti1laXJHSjM0VVlRWndSWmtfX19tb3VYQ3laUEc0aHdhSTZTc1NEWm5BbXpScmdYd0hiVHlqUlFMRVZudzUzc0RB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Common Dreams&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WION&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBpRjMycDJHV1VSdUl2cGVIbDVWQjVhWWRwdlhFS2w2WHVub3plX1ZQT0RCMG1mZDB4R2UzUzdoZ2NoQk5QVEcydDA5Q003c0luUmhBUzhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;PBS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQM3Z6Q0JZV3dBQ3RWM0JKcjVlYUJ0bnZUbkNpbEhOa1FGNld1LU